人民币）1.02，较昨日持平\n\n📝亚太市场整体走弱，半导体个股在全市场遭到抛售。科创 50、创业板指开盘一度各下跌","url":"https://x.com/2030FY_X/status/2109870579088314524"},{"author_id":"997722661844287488","created_at":"2026-10-13T11:41:51.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109972883720360043"],"id":"2109972883720360043","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":8341,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"创业板ETF易方达成交额超85亿元、科创50ETF华夏成交额超73亿元、沪深300ETF华泰柏瑞成交额超42亿元，中证1000ETF、中证500ETF等中小盘宽基同步放量","url":"https://x.com/dacefupan/status/2109972883720360043"},{"author_id":"1993506486069477376","created_at":"2026-10-13T05:47:22.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109883673277591774"],"id":"2109883673277591774","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":156,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"多只宽基ETF成交额超越昨日全天：创业板ETF易方达(159915)成交额超66亿元、A500ETF南方(159352)成交额超34亿元、沪深300ETF华泰柏瑞(510300)成交额33亿元、中证1000ETF南方(512100)成交额近30亿元。","url":"https://x.com/GuHiver/status/2109883673277591774"},{"author_id":"814736224988430336","created_at":"2026-10-13T05:15:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109875574575677753"],"id":"2109875574575677753","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2631,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"text":"13:13\n【宽基ETF显著放量成交】\n\n截至发稿时间，多只宽基ETF成交额超越昨日全天：\n\n创业板ETF易方达（159915）成交额超66亿元、A500ETF南方（159352）成交额超34亿元、沪深300ETF华泰柏瑞（510300）成交额33亿元、中证1000ETF南方（512100）成交额近30亿元。","url":"https://x.com/XiaoM17/status/2109875574575677753"},{"author_id":"2035018650965745664","created_at":"2026-10-13T06:16:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109890978022928810"],"id":"2109890978022928810","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":148,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"截至发稿时间，多只宽基ETF成交额超越昨日全天：创业板ETF易方达（159915）成交额超66亿元、A500ETF南方（159352）成交额超34亿元、沪深300ETF华泰柏瑞（510300）成交额33亿元、中证1000ETF南方（512100）成交额近30亿元。","url":"https://x.com/wolf200131313/status/2109890978022928810"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109883571544748032"]},"author_id":"1999693479178567681","created_at":"2026-10-13T05:46:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109883578524094850"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/HItODXU4bn","end":189,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/ZoXinkun2O26/status/2109883578524094850/photo/1","media_key":"3_2109883571544748032","start":166,"url":"https://t.co/HItODXU4bn"}]},"id":"2109883578524094850","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":39,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"A股上演大奇迹日！\n\n早盘创业板跌超3%，随后三大指数集体翻红，市场来了个大反转。\n\n资金也在快速进场，多只宽基ETF成交额已超过昨日全天：\n\n-创业板ETF易方达：超66亿元\n-A500ETF南方：超34亿元\n-沪深300ETF华泰柏瑞：33亿元\n-中证1000ETF南方：近30亿元\n\n感谢神秘大哥出手，\n关键时刻稳住了市场。 https://t.co/HItODXU4bn","url":"https://x.com/ZoXinkun2O26/status/2109883578524094850"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110010407704494081"]},"author_id":"1954164308537118720","created_at":"2026-10-13T14:10:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110010414633476478"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/Oq44B0LIZz","end":147,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/Not691209983377/status/2110010414633476478/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110010407704494081","start":124,"url":"https://t.co/Oq44B0LIZz"}]},"id":"2110010414633476478","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":639,"like_count":0,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":1},"text":"晚上好！今天有点事情更新晚了点。\n【10月13日复盘 | 探底回升收复3800，尾盘我接了星宸科技】\n一、今日盘面\n沪指涨0.10%报3800.86点，深证成指跌0.25%，创业板指跌0.18%。早盘三大指数低开，双创一度跌超3%，午后集体翻红。 https://t.co/Oq44B0LIZz","url":"https://x.com/Not691209983377/status/2110010414633476478"},{"author_id":"1609897027709861888","created_at":"2026-10-14T06:39:44.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110259243064689127"],"id":"2110259243064689127","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":649,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"【A股盘中】 2026年10月14日 14:30\n========================================\n⚠️ 数据截止14:30\n\n# A股盘中分析（2026年10月14日 14:30）\n\n## 一、盘面速览","url":"https://x.com/SYU77996/status/2110259243064689127"},{"author_id":"1913965111045398528","created_at":"2026-10-14T13:21:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110360294241546466"],"id":"2110360294241546466","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":20,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"一、缩量到1.41万亿比跌3%更值得警惕。过去三个交易日两市成交额原本一直维持在1.8万亿以上的高位活跃区间，全市场交易者普遍享受着高流动性行情的红利，不管是中小盘题材还是大盘权重蓝筹都有充足的资金承接，不少投资者甚至形成了“单日跌3%也会有抄底资金进场托底”的惯性思维，默认大跌之后很快就能","url":"https://x.com/m0sHown5gS16742/status/2110360294241546466"},{"author_id":"852245268389126144","created_at":"2026-10-13T07:19:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109906897730195873"],"id":"2109906897730195873","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":1246,"like_count":11,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":1},"text":"技术面上，沪指今天收在3819点，站上了短期均线，但上方3850到3900点这个区间压力不小，那是之前的密集成交区，套牢盘不少。创业板指收在2993点，离3000点整数关口就差一点点，这个位置突破需要量能配合。","url":"https://x.com/Jwaher49783608/status/2109906897730195873"},{"author_id":"137332930","created_at":"2026-10-14T12:20:41.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110345045987701056"],"id":"2110345045987701056","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":8439,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":15,"retweet_count":0},"text":"今日中国A股热点二十条\n（一）\n1、据东方财富报道，国家统计局公布9月CPI同比上涨0.9%，PPI同比上涨5%，其中AI算力需求带动电子制造提价，汽油价格上涨16.6%。","url":"https://x.com/cnfinancewatch/status/2110345045987701056"},{"author_id":"556658912","created_at":"2026-10-14T04:30:47.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110226791009050957"],"id":"2110226791009050957","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":749,"like_count":10,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":1},"text":"【10.14收盘】\n大盘低开震荡，沪指小幅翻红，创业板偏弱，市场整体缩量，下跌个股数量更多。\n\n盘面上油气板块领涨，国际油价走高，资金流向资源防御方向。水产养殖迎来爆发，百洋股份打出4连板。PCB板块继续走强，超声电子二连板，靠三季报业绩预喜支撑；AI软件借着产业大会的消息局部异动。","url":"https://x.com/sezinzelik/status/2110226791009050957"},{"author_id":"1996551578187436033","created_at":"2026-10-13T07:30:47.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109909701148176648"],"id":"2109909701148176648","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":697,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"深V反抽收红：沪指+0.10%收复3800，创业板从盘中-3.5%捞回-0.18%\n\n▪️ 午后指数变动","url":"https://x.com/YoooJJ8cm/status/2109909701148176648"},{"author_id":"51315943","created_at":"2026-10-14T12:22:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110345537316905316"],"id":"2110345537316905316","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":9,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"📉【10月14日中国及香港股市收盘分析】\n\n🇨🇳 A股： 三大指数集体收跌，上证指数跌0.88%，深证成指跌1.97%，创业板指跌3.10%。两市成交额约1.41万亿元，较前一交易日明显缩量。石油、煤炭表现较强，AI硬件、通信及部分成长板块承压。\n\n🇭🇰 港股：","url":"https://x.com/lifeofchives/status/2110345537316905316"},{"author_id":"935426652749799425","created_at":"2026-10-14T15:26:56.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110391914172436889"],"id":"2110391914172436889","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":118,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"A股缩量轮动：科技回调，红利接棒\n\n10月14日，A股三大指数集体收跌：上证-0.88%、深成指-1.97%、创业板指-3.1%。成交额1.43万亿，较前一日缩量2625亿元，4496只个股下跌。","url":"https://x.com/compoundingblue/status/2110391914172436889"},{"author_id":"3097944448","created_at":"2026-10-13T05:09:26.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109874128866181219"],"id":"2109874128866181219","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":479,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"A股的天塌了\n\n沪深两市成交额只有1.54万亿，比上一个交易日直接缩量了3600多亿。\n\n全市场超过4300只个股下跌，创业板指跌了2.61%，深证成指跌了2.03%。但是，上证指数只跌了0.43%。\n\n沪强深弱，非常明显。","url":"https://x.com/Hy9788/status/2109874128866181219"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109982288561975296"]},"author_id":"2095194257904844800","created_at":"2026-10-13T12:19:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109982301144916183"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/HRvnjFpjJr","end":1